<yolodex version="1">
  <card id="1">
    <index>Apple pie</index>
    <body>Preheat the oven to 375°F.
Lattice the top. Egg wash.
Bake until the juices bubble.</body>
  </card>
  <card id="2">
    <index>Baker</index>
    <body>Sourdough starter lives in the fridge.
Feed it the night before you bake.</body>
  </card>
  <card id="3">
    <index>Contacts</index>
    <body>Pie tin: Aunt Marge.
Eggs: corner market, not the supermarket.</body>
  </card>
  <card id="4">
    <index>Zoo hours</index>
    <body>Weekdays 9–5. Sunday noon–4.
Closed Christmas Day.</body>
  </card>
